      "all_locations": "San Francisco, CA, USA; Remote",
      "long_description": "Radley is the first AI-native radiology practice. We're acquiring a radiology practice bringing Radley to $4.3M in annualized revenue and rebuilding it with agents from the ground up.\r\n\r\nRadiology is already in crisis: there aren't enough radiologists to interpret 1 in 6 medical scans. In 10 years, that gap is growing to 1 in 3 - 246M scans a year.\r\n\r\nWe started as an AI software company, signed $2.2M in contracts, and went live, but learned the real bottleneck isn't software, it's outdated systems and slow, inefficient operations. That's why we own the full stack, clinical and operational, end to end.\r\n\r\nWe met at Carbon Health as we scaled operations 31x and expanded to 100+ clinics. Now we're rebuilding radiology.",
